{"about_the_game":"Wonky Pigeon! is a deliberately absurd and clumsy game made as a joke and parody rather than a serious action project.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou play as a pigeon in chaotic and often pointless situations where what happens feels more like a gag or a sketch than traditional gameplay. Controls may feel awkward, physics unpredictable, and the result funny or irritating depending on expectations.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWonky Pigeon! is not a polished game with high production quality. Many negative reviews are related to technical roughness and strange controls \u2014 this is part of the game's concept and format.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game is suitable for those who enjoy absurd humor, treat clumsiness as part of the joke, and are looking for a short and strange game experience without serious expectations.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/364710?t=1769745691","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/364710?t=1769745691","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/364710/e086568728e16877cc8a2f487e4519deb3aed24b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769745691","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/364710/e086568728e16877cc8a2f487e4519deb3aed24b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769745691","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>FIND HMUR!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/364710/extras/b009372be95605a3fb4580f8fe3b1d8f.poster.avif?t=1769745691\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/364710/extras/b009372be95605a3fb4580f8fe3b1d8f.webm?t=1769745691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/364710/extras/b009372be95605a3fb4580f8fe3b1d8f.mp4?t=1769745691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Wonky Pigeon! is a deliberately absurd and clumsy game made as a joke and parody rather than a serious action project.<br><br>You play as a pigeon in chaotic and often pointless situations where what happens feels more like a gag or a sketch than traditional gameplay. Controls may feel awkward, physics unpredictable, and the result funny or irritating depending on expectations.<br><br>Wonky Pigeon! is not a polished game with high production quality. Many negative reviews are related to technical roughness and strange controls \u2014 this is part of the game's concept and format.<br><br>The game is suitable for those who enjoy absurd humor, treat clumsiness as part of the joke, and are looking for a short and strange game experience without serious expectations.","developers":["Carlotta Tatti"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/364710/ffbbee886031882e38ff52754453095a2d81f863/header.jpg?t=1769745691","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 10.10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2,5 GHz Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum